---
title: Clint Reyes joins Seo Lab @ UHM for summer 2025!
date: 2025-07-01
---

Excited to work with Clint Reyes, a graduate student in the Department of Ocean and Resources Engineering t the University of Hawai‘i at Mānoa (SOEST/UHM). In the summer of 2025, he will be working with Hyodae Seo and Cesar Sauvage to investigate nearshore wave dynamics around the Okinawa Islands during Super Typhoon Khanun (2023) using numerical model simulations. His thesis research interests at ORE/SOEST include coastal engineering, coral reef hydrodynamics, and marine renewable energy. Find out more about him [here](authors/reyes).
